               <msContents>
                  <summary>Baptismal Ritual, Prayer for the Dedication of the Water, Prayer of Blessing and Imposition of the Hand</summary>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
                    <locus from="1r" to="44r" facs="005"/>
                    <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1940Mashaf">Maṣḥafa krǝstǝnnā (General record)</title>
                    <textLang mainLang="gez">Gǝ‘ǝz</textLang>
                    <incipit>በስመ፡ አብ፡<gap reason="omitted"/>መጽሐፈ፡ ክርስቶና፡ ቅድስት፡ ወይብል፡ መዝሙረ፡ ዘ፶ወጸሎተ፡ አኰቴት፡ ወየሐትት፡ አስማቲሆሙ፡ ለእለ፡ ይጠመቁ፡<gap reason="omitted"/></incipit>
                      <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.1">
                        <locus from="38v" facs="043"/>
                        <title>Prayer for the de-consecration of the water</title>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez">ወፈጺሞ፡ ይበል፡ ዘንተ፡ ፍትሐ፡ ማይ፡ እግዚኦ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ አምላክነ፡ አምላከ፡ ኵሉ፡ ፍጥረት፡ ወኵሉ፡ እምኀበ፡ አልቦ፡ በጥበቡ፡ ፈጠረ፡ ለዘአስተሃባእኮሙ፡ ለማያት፡<gap reason="omitted"/></incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.2">
                      <locus target="#40r" facs="044"/>
                      <title>Prayer of blessing and imposition of the hand</title>
                      <incipit xml:lang="gez">ጸሎተ፡ ባርኮ፡ ወአንብሮ፡ እድ፡ ለእለ፡ ይጠመቁ፡ ቅድመ፡ ቅብዓ፡ ሜሮን፡ ነአኵተከ፡ እግዚኦ፡ ዘረሰይኮሙ፡ ድልዋነ፡ ለአግብርቲከ፡ ለሕፅበተ፡ ዳግም፡ ልደት፡<gap reason="omitted"/></incipit>
                    </msItem>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
